e insurer along with the policy document that\nprovides in simple words, important information and basic features of the policy\nissued at one place.\n2. CIS is to be provided with every policy in the format as given in Schedule D for Life\ninsurance policy. The CIS shall\ni. be provided to every policyholder in case of both Individual Insurance policy\nholder as well as a Member of a Group Insurance Policy.\nii. have details like\n104 | पृ �/ Pa ge"
