roceeds by repurchase of the units\nat the Net Asset Value (NAV) of the units on the date of cancellation.\nvi. The applicable refund of premium upon free look cancellation shall be refunded\nwithin 7 days of receipt of request for free look cancellation. In case of any delay\nin refund, the insurer shall:\na) refund such amounts along with interest at the bank rate plus 2 percent on\nthe refundable amount, from the date of receipt of the request for free look\ncancellation till the date of refund. This penal interest is without prejudice to\nany other penalty that may be levied by the Authority for non-compliance.\nb) Such interest shall be paid suo-moto by the insurer.\n105 | पृ �/ Pa ge"
