d / partially resolved complaints to\nInsurance Ombudsman of concerned jurisdiction, in case the claim amount is up to\nRs. 50 lakhs.\nii. The policyholder has option to take up the matter before insurance ombudsman of\ncompetent jurisdiction without any charge / fee through any of the following options:\na. In person;\nb. Online by visiting https://cioins.co.in/Complaint/Online;\nc. In writing through post or through email by giving complete details.\n123 | पृ �/ Pa ge"
