he Acquiring insurer shall decide and communicate on the proposal at the\nearliest possible time but not more than 5 days of receipt of information from\nExisting insurer.\nvi. A policyholder desirous of porting his/her policy to another insurer shall apply to\nsuch insurer to port the entire policy along with all the members of the family, if\nany, at least 30 days before, but not earlier than 60 days from the due date for\nrenewal. Insurers are free to consider proposal for portability even if the\npolicyholder has approached within 15 days from the renewal date of the existing\n125 | पृ �/ Pa ge"
