 to the\nprospective policyholder along with the sales literature before concluding the sale.\n9. The format of benefit illustration is given as under\n9.1. Annexure 1: BI for Linked Life Insurance Products\n9.2. Annexure 2: BI for Linked Pension Products\n158 | पृ �/ Pa ge"
